  "details": "Recently, optimization has been increasingly emphasized by the VRChat team with features like Avatar Performance Gated Group Instances, so wouldn’t it be about time to implement this kind of filtering?\n\nBy making it easier to choose appropriate avatars for each instance, it would also enhance the effectiveness of Performance Gate.\n\nIt seems there are plans to take uncompressed size into account in Avatar Performance Gated Group Instances in the future, so if that’s the case, starting with just performance rank and uncompressed size would be fine for now.\n\nhttps://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-9-april-2026/48173/127",
